I’m ready to help! Let’s start by arranging your morning commute. I’ll look for a ride from **123 Main Street** to **456 Park Avenue** that costs no more than **$30**.  

```json
{
  "name": "ride_hailing_get_rides",
  "arguments": {
    "source": "123 Main Street",
    "destination": "456 Park Avenue",
    "max_cost": 30.0
  }
}
```
